				<img height="283" src="img/hamsterslunch030_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/HamstersLunchi/img/hamsterslunch030.jpg" --></a><a href="img/hamsterslunch031.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/hamsterslunch031_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/HamstersLunchi/img/hamsterslunch031.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
